      },
      {
        "text": "The First Command\nType: Dynamic\nSetting: \nScope: Local\nSituation: The Ancestor, a consciousness bound to Kato's blood, has identified Mr. Henderson, the landlord, as the first node of control in the building. It is compelling Kato to magically dominate the man to begin establishing a territory of power.\nComplication: Kato needs to exert this control to understand and survive the force inside him, but doing so means crossing a line from self-preservation to active tyranny, irrevocably aligning his will with the Ancestor's.\nActors:\n- Kato: Needs to assert dominance over the new power coiled in his gut before it consumes him, but cannot do so without becoming the monster the voice wants him to be.\n- Mr. Henderson: Needs to maintain his authority and collect rent to preserve his small kingdom, but is utterly blind to the true nature of the threat standing at his door, making any attempt at resistance meaningless.",
        "contextConfig": {
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "\n",
          "tokenBudget": 1,
          "reservedTokens": 0,
          "budgetPriority": 400,
          "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
